flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read n/]
    B --> C{n ≤ 0?}
    C -->|Yes| D[/Print Invalid input/]
    D --> Z([Stop])
    C -->|No| E[a ← 0, b ← 1, count ← 1]
    E --> F{count ≤ n?}
    F -->|Yes| G[/Print a/]
    G --> H[next ← a + b]
    H --> I[a ← b]
    I --> J[b ← next]
    J --> K[count ← count + 1]
    K --> F
    F -->|No| Z
